**Prathamikta:**

1. GTA V mein C++ modding ke liye, aapko GTA V ke source code ko edit karna hoga. Yeh ek jatil prakriya hai aur aapko GTA V ke source code ko edit karne ke liye GTA V ke source code ke liye ek compiler aur editor ki aavashyakta hogi.
2. GTA V mein Monero mining ka ek custom mod banaane ke liye, aapko Monero mining ke liye ek C++ program likhna hoga jo GTA V ke background mein chal sakta ho.
3. GTA V mein Monero mining ka ek custom mod banaane ke liye, aapko GTA V ke task manager mein bhi chhup jana hoga. Yeh aapko GTA V ke task manager mein Monero mining ke liye ek separate process banane ki aavashyakta hogi.

